      "title": "Clinical Nursing Instructor",
      "description": "Clinical Nursing Instructor - Faculty of Nursing- 0.6 FTE Five-Month Term Position - Psychiatric Mental Health Nursing (Charlottetown) and Long-Term Care (King's County) | UPEI Skip to main content Audience Future Students Current Students International Students Parents and Supporters Alumni Action Careers Contribute Contact myUPEI Info for ... » Info for ... Future Students Current Students International Students Parents and Supporters Alumni × search Custom Search Sort by Relevance Date Main navigation Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Faculties and Schools Professional Development Robertson Library UPEI Course Catalogue Student Life Athletics and Recreation Parents and Supporters Student Supports and Services Residence Life Health and Wellness Research Our Chairs Research Services Find a Researcher Resources and Tools Key Research Dates Robertson Library Apply How to Apply Tuition and Fees Admission Requirements Scholarships, Awards, and Financial Aid Career Development About Us About UPEI History and Mission Governance Explore the Campus Careers at UPEI Action Careers Contribute Contact myUPEI Main navigation Academics Student Life Research Apply About Us Action Careers Contribute Contact myUPEI Info for ... » Future Students Current Students International Students Parents and Supporters Alumni × search Custom Search Sort by Relevance Date Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Faculties and Schools Professional Development Robertson Library UPEI Course Catalogue Mega Menu - Image - Programs UPEI programs are designed to bring out your best, lead you to realize new talents, and be great at what you do. Student Life Athletics and Recreation Parents and Supporters Student Supports and Services Residence Life Health and Wellness Mega Menu - Image - Student Life Amazing student experiences, state-of-the-art facilities, and opportunities to make your place in the world. Research Our Chairs Research Services Find a Re